&lt;p style=&quot;padding:10px;&quot;>&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:larger;&quot;>By law, AARO may receive all UAP-related information, including any classified national security information, regardless of any restrictive access controls, special access programs, or compartmented access programs.  Moreover, there is no restriction to AARO receiving any past or present UAP-related information, regardless of the organizational affiliation of the original classification authority within DoW, the Intelligence Community, or any other U.S. Government department or agency. As a reminder, &lt;b>&lt;i>individuals cannot report classified national security information on this website.&lt;/i>&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>

