   <p>This email is for official reports from <b>current or former U.S. Government employees, service members, or contractor personnel</b> with direct knowledge of U.S. Government programs or activities related to UAP. Please do not submit reports of UAP sightings or information other than that solicited in the form. You may be contacted by AARO if additional information is needed.</p>

